WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:07.630
"I see Planet Freeze," Bot said.

2
00:00:07.631 --> 00:00:13.800
Ringo shivered. "There's a lot of ice."

3
00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:21.263
Bot nodded. "That's a big frozen ocean."

4
00:00:21.264 --> 00:00:27.258
"I see water too!" Ringo said.

5
00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:31.555
Bot pointed to a big sun.

6
00:00:31.556 --> 00:00:36.134
"Planet Freeze's sun looks really big.

7
00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:39.989
It should be smaller."

8
00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.689
"Aha!" Ringo cried.

9
00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:49.775
"That's why the planet is melting!"

10
00:00:49.776 --> 00:01:01.135
The spaceship flew down to the planet.

11
00:01:01.136 --> 00:01:14.314
Ringo and Bot found the Freezies' village.

12
00:01:14.315 --> 00:01:20.332
The buildings were domes.

13
00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:27.115
Ringo saw some ice mountains.

14
00:01:27.116 --> 00:01:32.095
"This planet has so much ice and snow."

15
00:01:32.096 --> 00:01:35.645
He took a step. Splash!

16
00:01:35.646 --> 00:01:39.910
"And puddles too!"

17
00:01:39.911 --> 00:01:43.215
Bot looked at the ground.

18
00:01:43.216 --> 00:01:48.553
"There are cracks in the ice," she said.

19
00:01:48.554 --> 00:01:52.711
"Space Patrol!" A Freezie hurried over.

20
00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.911
He stomped through puddles.

21
00:01:56.912 --> 00:02:01.843
"I'm Zoop, leader of the Freezies."

22
00:02:01.844 --> 00:02:05.697
Ringo told Zoop about the sun.

23
00:02:05.698 --> 00:02:13.638
Zoop frowned. "So the sun is melting the ice!"

24
00:02:13.639 --> 00:02:18.204
"It's melting fast," Bot said.

25
00:02:18.205 --> 00:02:22.388
Zoop shook his head. "This is bad.

26
00:02:22.389 --> 00:02:25.641
Freezies like cold places.

27
00:02:25.642 --> 00:02:29.888
We must leave Planet Freeze at once!"

28
00:02:29.889 --> 00:02:33.808
"Where will you go?" Ringo asked.

29
00:02:33.809 --> 00:02:36.603
Zoop looked up at the sky.

30
00:02:36.604 --> 00:02:42.066
"The Freezies will move to Planet Ice."

